This is a test PDF content for the multimodal RAG system.

It contains sample text that will be used to test the PDF upload functionality. The system should be able to extract this text and make it searchable.

The purpose of this test is to verify that:
1. PDF uploads work correctly
2. Text extraction functions properly
3. Documents are stored in the database
4. Processing jobs are created

This represents a typical text document that users might upload to the system in PDF format.